---
// short-series/src/pages/privacy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const canonicalURL = new URL('/privacy/', Astro.site ?? 'https://tradeopportunities.trade').href;
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy // Trade Opportunities"
  description="Privacy policy, cookie consent guidelines, and telemetry disclosures for Trade Opportunities."
  canonicalURL={canonicalURL}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="bitmedia-site-verification" content="07522f1ef9d6b60ae5363fe10b37f8c5" />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="legal-container">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Return to Market Terminal</a>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: August 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Non-Custodial & No-Account Design</h2>
    <p>
      Trade Opportunities operates without account registration, logins, or private customer databases. We never ask for, hold, or process your personal banking details, private keys, or wallet seed phrases.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Anonymous Technical Telemetry</h2>
    <p>
      To ensure market data availability and optimize client-side performance, standard automated server logs may record basic diagnostic information such as your IP address, browser type, and page access timestamps.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Cookies & Embedded Widgets</h2>
    <p>
      We do not deploy invasive marketing trackers. However, third-party widgets and contextual ad providers (such as A-ADS, Bitmedia, TradingView, and ChangeNOW) may deploy functional cookies to maintain session states and prevent click fraud.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Email Newsletter Subscriptions & Dispatch Delivery</h2>
    <p>
      When you subscribe to our daily market scans and momentum dispatches, your email address is processed securely through <strong>Resend</strong> (Resend, Inc.) solely for outbound dispatch delivery. Your email is never sold, rented, or shared with third-party advertising brokers. You may permanently remove your email address at any time using the one-click unsubscribe link included in every automated dispatch.
    </p>

    <h2>5. External Outbound Links</h2>
    <p>
      Our market intelligence bulletins contain outbound links to external exchange terminals and data providers. We encourage you to review the individual privacy terms of those third-party services.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container { 
    max-width: 820px; 
    margin: 2.5rem auto 4rem auto; 
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }
  h1 { 
    font-size: 2rem; 
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem; 
    font-weight: 800; 
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }
  .last-updated { 
    font-size: 0.8rem; 
    color: #64748b; 
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; 
    margin-bottom: 2rem; 
  }
  h2 { 
    font-size: 1.25rem; 
    margin-top: 1.75rem; 
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem; 
    color: #f1f5f9; 
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  p { 
    font-size: 0.925rem; 
    color: #94a3b8; 
    margin-bottom: 1rem; 
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  a { 
    color: #3b82f6; 
    text-decoration: none; 
    font-weight: 600; 
  }
  a:hover { 
    text-decoration: underline; 
  }
  .back-link { 
    display: inline-block; 
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem; 
    font-size: 0.85rem; 
  }
</style>
